# EARNWINGS landing — founder waitlist endpoint.
#
# Recommended: the included Google Apps Script backend (200-seat cap + founder
# perks, stored in a Google Sheet). See apps-script/EarnwingsWaitlist.gs.
#
# Deploy that script as a Web App ("Anyone" access), then paste its /exec URL here:
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=https://script.google.com/macros/s/XXXX/exec
#
# The form GETs `?action=stats` for live seats-left and POSTs (text/plain) the
# sign-up { email, name, examTarget, source }. Leave BLANK for demo mode
# (form works and shows success, but stores nothing).

VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
